---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /sf/index.html
title: Bay Area Neighbourhood Field Notes
bodyClass: "sf-page"
robots: "noindex, nofollow, noarchive"
externalStyles:
  - https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css
  - /assets/sf/sf.css?v=field-notes-1
pageScripts:
  - https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js
  - /assets/sf/sf.js?v=field-notes-1
---

<header class="sf-hero">
  <div class="sf-shell hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="kicker"><span></span> Unlisted field notes · August–September 2026</p>
      <h1>Finding a place<br>by the <em>Bay</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-intro">A street-level record of San Francisco, Berkeley and North Oakland—what the housing, weather, pace and connections actually felt like while moving through them.</p>
      <div class="hero-stats" aria-label="Collection summary">
        <div><strong>{{ sf.stats.areas }}</strong><span>areas</span></div>
        <div><strong>{{ sf.stats.photos }}</strong><span>photos</span></div>
        <div><strong>{{ sf.stats.videos }}</strong><span>route videos</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="overview-wrap">
      <div id="sf-overview-map" class="overview-map" aria-label="Map of the seven Bay Area neighborhoods"></div>
      <p class="map-caption">San Francisco · Berkeley · Oakland</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="sf-shell sf-main">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <p class="kicker"><span></span> Neighborhoods</p>
    <h2>Open an area to explore</h2>
    <p>The galleries follow each outing in chronological order. Map dots mark the start points of retained route videos; photos are grouped by the surrounding neighborhood.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="area-list">
    {% for area in sf.areas %}
      {% set areaMedia = sfMedia[area.key] %}
      <details class="area-card" data-area="{{ area.key }}">
        <summary data-center-lat="{{ area.mapCenter[0] }}" data-center-lon="{{ area.mapCenter[1] }}" data-zoom="{{ area.mapZoom }}">
          <span class="summary-copy">
            <span class="area-number">0{{ loop.index }}</span>
            <span class="area-eyebrow">{{ area.eyebrow }}</span>
            <span class="area-title-row">
              <span class="area-name">{{ area.name }}</span>
              <span class="media-count">{{ areaMedia.length }} items</span>
            </span>
            <span class="area-summary">{{ area.summary }}</span>
            <span class="open-label"><span>Explore the field notes</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
          </span>
          <span class="mini-map-wrap">
            <span id="map-{{ area.key }}" class="mini-map" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="boundary-label">Recorded area</span>
          </span>
        </summary>

        <div class="area-expanded">
          <p class="decision-note">{{ area.decisionNote }}</p>
          <div class="media-grid">
            {% for item in areaMedia %}
              {% if item.type == "image" %}
                <button class="media-card image-card" type="button" data-full="{{ item.src }}" data-alt="{{ area.name }} street view" data-area-name="{{ area.name }}">
                  <img src="{{ item.src }}" alt="{{ area.name }} street view" width="{{ item.width }}" height="{{ item.height }}" loading="lazy">
                  <span class="media-kind">Photo</span>
                </button>
              {% else %}
                <figure class="media-card video-card" data-lat="{{ item.latitude }}" data-lon="{{ item.longitude }}">
                  <video controls playsinline preload="none" poster="{{ item.poster }}" aria-label="{{ area.name }} route video">
                    <source data-src="{{ item.src }}" type="video/mp4">
                  </video>
                  <figcaption><span>Route video</span><time>{{ item.duration }} sec</time></figcaption>
                </figure>
              {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <p class="source-note">Locations are reconstructed from the original capture sequence and embedded video coordinates. Repeated frames, unusably blurred images, transit-only shots and the separate ferry outing were removed.</p>
</main>

<dialog id="sf-lightbox" class="lightbox">
  <button class="lightbox-close" type="button" aria-label="Close image">×</button>
  <div class="lightbox-layout sf-lightbox-layout">
    <div class="lightbox-image-wrap"><img src="" alt=""></div>
    <aside class="lightbox-location sf-lightbox-caption">
      <div class="lightbox-location-copy">
        <span>Neighborhood field note</span>
        <strong id="sf-lightbox-area"></strong>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</dialog>
